          </GlassCard>
          <GlassCard v-else-if="step===3"><div class="section-title"><div><h2>参数联动</h2><p>设置参数在指定条件下显示；保存检查会识别无效引用。</p></div></div><div class="rules"><div v-for="parameter in config.parameters" :key="parameter.key"><b>{{ parameter.label }}</b><select v-model="parameter.visible_when"><option :value="undefined">始终显示</option><option v-for="source in config.parameters.filter(v=>v.key!==parameter.key)" :key="source.key" :value="{key:source.key,operator:'truthy'}">当 {{ source.label }} 开启时显示</option></select><template v-if="parameter.visible_when"><select v-model="parameter.visible_when.operator"><option value="truthy">为真</option><option value="equals">等于</option><option value="not_equals">不等于</option></select><input v-if="parameter.visible_when.operator!=='truthy'" v-model="parameter.visible_when.value" placeholder="比较值" /></template></div></div></GlassCard>
          <GlassCard v-else-if="step===4"><div class="section-title"><div><h2>尺寸与参数方案</h2><p>维护类型专属方案；动作迁移的多参开关、图数和跳过秒数仍保留为任务参数。</p></div><V2Button variant="primary" @click="addScheme">新增方案</V2Button></div><div class="schemes"><article v-for="(scheme,index) in config.parameter_schemes" :key="scheme.id"><header><input v-model="scheme.name" /><label><input type="radio" :checked="scheme.is_default" @change="setDefaultScheme(index)"/> 默认</label><button @click="config.parameter_schemes.splice(index,1)">删除</button></header><div class="scheme-values"><V2Field v-for="parameter in config.parameters.filter(p=>!['image','video','audio'].includes(p.type)&&!['multi_reference_enabled','multi_reference_count','skip_seconds'].includes(p.key))" :key="parameter.key" :label="parameter.label"><input v-model="scheme.params[parameter.key]" /></V2Field></div></article><p v-if="!config.parameter_schemes.length" class="empty">暂无参数方案，可直接使用参数默认值。</p></div></GlassCard>
          <GlassCard v-else-if="step===5"><div class="section-title"><div><h2>工作流上传与绑定</h2><p>上传 ComfyUI API JSON 后，根据参数设计器中的参数自动匹配；参数 key 在两处保持完全一致。</p></div><V2Button variant="primary" @click="workflowImportOpen=true">上传工作流 JSON</V2Button></div><div class="workflow-guide"><span><b>1</b>上传 API JSON</span><i>›</i><span><b>2</b>关联页面参数</span><i>›</i><span><b>3</b>匹配节点属性</span><i>›</i><span><b>4</b>保存并绑定</span></div><div class="workflow-layout"><div><h3>可用工作流</h3><button v-for="workflow in workflows" :key="workflow.id" :disabled="!workflow.current_version_id" @click="bindWorkflow(workflow)"><span><b>{{ workflow.name }}</b><small>版本 #{{ workflow.current_version_id || '无可用版本' }}</small></span><i>＋</i></button><p v-if="!workflows.length" class="empty">当前类型没有工作流，请点击右上角上传。</p></div><div><h3>已绑定</h3><article v-for="(binding,index) in config.workflow_bindings" :key="binding.workflow_version_id"><span><b>{{ workflows.find(v=>v.id===binding.workflow_id)?.name || `工作流 #${binding.workflow_id}` }}</b><small>版本 #{{ binding.workflow_version_id }}</small></span><label><input type="radio" :checked="binding.is_default" @change="setDefaultWorkflow(index)"/> 默认</label><button @click="editBoundWorkflow(binding)">编辑 / 重传 JSON</button><button @click="removeBinding(index)">移除</button></article><p v-if="!config.workflow_bindings.length" class="empty">尚未绑定工作流</p></div></div><div v-if="validation?.workflow_checks.length" class="mapping-checks"><h3>映射完整度</h3><div v-for="checkItem in validation.workflow_checks" :key="checkItem.workflow_version_id"><StatusBadge :tone="checkItem.valid&&!checkItem.missing_parameters.length?'success':'warning'">{{ checkItem.valid?'工作流有效':'绑定错误' }}</StatusBadge><span>版本 #{{ checkItem.workflow_version_id }}</span><small>{{ checkItem.missing_parameters.length ? `缺少：${checkItem.missing_parameters.join('、')}` : '参数映射完整' }}</small></div></div></GlassCard>
